  "body": "## Changelog\n### Features\n* fcbacabbba6f9fa4c405d2d94a54a8ade0298dd4 feat(asciicast): read asciicast v3 recordings (#40)\n* d0d2275a9389e3d570e6393c3664aaa2b6e08eee feat(examples): GIF and WebM examples, reproducible WebM and size table (#42)\n* 3986c00be6b0174ee1435ed417ccd1b331e6d505 feat(raster): glyph fallback fonts and --system-fonts for GIF and WebM (#43)\n### Bug fixes\n* 0c0e7b7c49735f3bf9fa98616a4e29b3fe9c5705 fix(ir): show each frame from when its event happens, for as long as it lasts (#45)\n* eb4d393111d29487438ed94bf20d2e6b436303a3 fix(record): resize-watcher race and --skip-first-line chunk bug (#30)\n* d2fa4204055b83005c8276ed49d7f2a4dd4ac11a fix: v3 follow-ups, deterministic GIF palette and Windows build (#41)\n### Others\n* 7d7d8051da5ad66a06469e49f2e10d2a5b8ace60 ci: run lint and tests as independent jobs (#31)\n* 036363ba2e05e049b559eaa122dda5181efbdc48 perf(webm): encode only distinct frames at constant quality (#44)\n* 67dd4965b9c09bdfe49efd5f729efc4bf52f6825 refactor(cmd): stage 1 cleanups (themegen, export, CLI entrypoint) (#28)\n* 270d3120e18feaf02002686f0dad915bd3e417e3 refactor(svg): extract rowWriter from canvas for row painting (#34)\n* 59c87f5dd55048639ef5ea513abe9f1221e54cd4 refactor(svg): extract smilWriter (#37)\n* 36e7a49b9eb6a85b475a34a90595a38c1d77bb0f refactor(svg): extract stylePlanner and split buildStylePlan (#35)\n* 58b2852a4a5d9b83ccf88e52e6973ad12b20bf40 refactor(svg): move plan-only computations onto semanticPlan and document canvas (#38)\n* c7424ad0ea4a67a22eae1d4ad32041f2b000057d refactor(svg): split renderer.go into focused files (#29)\n* 41ffc7101d1f075675ae24bf4c8ef687aee85da7 refactor(svg): stage 4d — extract rowCollector (#36)\n* 9190fc72082cfa54c37c7e22d061a7df831d52fe refactor(svg): turn state-free sharing helpers into package functions (#33)\n* 68689c075aec1c9aab455199eaba20fdc357d9e5 refactor: move pkg/ to internal/ (#27)\n* 2af3376a5434267e765773311f67085ee44b9322 refactor: untangle codebase (shared engines, single sources of truth, dead code removal) (#46)\n\n"
